Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelfth Episode\NThe Prince and the Gypsy\NThe Ragged Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sapphire! Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my companion Gem for being so rude just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you and this gentleman weren't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it! As you can see—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! How can you stand there laughing after our friend got badly hurt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, he's pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the Prince of Silverland. Wait, a prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like much for a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pretty shabby yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gypsies, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gypsies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a Gypsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're folks who travel all year round—singing, doing magic tricks, and stealing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about your father and mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom and dad died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice to be a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once, I'd like to boss people around in a place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I let you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tease me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do that just as a favor for a Gypsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of making a face like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you two look identical!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm reading a book called The Prince and the Pauper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about a prince and a beggar swapping places. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, just like in the book, Gem and I are going to swap places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even had dinner yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, he's late. What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I can't tell which is which!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem, make sure you come back here by evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, isn't that Tink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The town bullies caught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.85,0:05:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well! Are you a friend of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Picking on the weak isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You've got some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want him back, you'll have to duel me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You big neighborhood bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yah! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not... I mean, I am the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, wait... hey, I know you, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, does my voice sound strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I've caught a cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, look how late it's getting...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we must head back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Water, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, Gem, you've got some nerve kicking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought your friends had abandoned you and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem, I shall tell your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,An ill-omened star hangs over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... one, five, eight... thirteen cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:08:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem, your star is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My, Gem... your card says you're a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My, I've really gotten old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dinner is over there, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't earn a single coin today. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're only getting half a portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, who are...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Gem's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tell anyone, so please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he not coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for various reasons, I swapped places with your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the prince of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so you're a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Liz, the little bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Liz, you've come back too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already evening, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotten so dark already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, or it'll get dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last of the potion that reveals whether Sapphire is a boy or a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistakes this time, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Coat your blade with it. It turns blue on a man, and red on a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And bright yellow on an egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:10:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's the Prince we have business with!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't searched here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no fear, it is Nylon. I've driven off the intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, lift your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Of course I'm a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Gem is waiting. Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, Gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't escape that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag them all away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So Prince Sapphire really is a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense! That fool's potion must have failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, Lord Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The potion's effect will never fail, even if the sun rises in the west. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To think Sapphire was a boy all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, our last resort is to kill Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But those three assassins aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've tamed the Gypsies, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended to bring back the real Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm lying, bring anyone you want from the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you all hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem's finally lost his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,t's not a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to run away when he doesn't even earn his keep—I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll work in his place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll give you a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut Pepper's ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this bundle to town and sell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! If you sell it all by dawn, I'll spare Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to buy anything this late?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail, he gets hanged!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Brother! I promise I'll sell it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.93,0:15:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy! I'm scared! Daddy! Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the town...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would anyone like some firewood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Would anyone like some firewood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Would anyone like some...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My firewood...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to gather it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl is drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Goro-goro-san Come on, come on, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Goro-goro-san thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't... don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After I went through all the trouble to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Save this child!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that Heavenly Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At least say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother must have given it to me in my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.95,0:19:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pepper isn't back yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're not back by dawn, it's the gallows!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ton
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut Gem's rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gypsy scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks important!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Officers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's official castle business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hear my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.55,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,By order of the castle... for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Sapphire goes for a walk with Lord Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when we kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get four men at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, assemble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us do this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, this is official castle business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Save my big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If Big Brother dies, Pepper will die too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lil!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.23,0:21:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Sapphire, will surely save your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.09,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A morning ride truly is delightful, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It is an honor to accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor is fine, but slow down a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us head back to the castle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He always rushes off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He went the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your Highness!\N- Gem
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.41,0:22:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't you Gem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.82,0:22:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.98,0:23:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness really is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem, what about the assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That pole hit them earlier, so they're knocked out cold over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gem, did you enjoy yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.77,0:23:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was totally boring in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There were always guards watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot happened on my end, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel I learned quite a lot from it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pepper is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.12,0:23:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.84,0:24:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That prince was an imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,An imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An imposter!
